WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.707
UniMax makes four contributions.

00:00:03.787 --> 00:00:07.493
First, the method itself,

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:11.280
which allocates the training budget uniformly while
capping how many times any single language repeats.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:15.067
Second, an extensive ablation of sampling
strategies run across model scales,

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:18.853
the systematic study the field had been missing.

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:22.640
Third,

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.427
a refreshed mC4 corpus of twenty-nine trillion
characters spanning one hundred seven languages.

00:00:26.507 --> 00:00:30.213
And fourth, released umT5 checkpoints trained with UniMax,

00:00:30.293 --> 00:00:34.000
so practitioners can build on this work directly.
